_vrf_PLAT112_ALERT_2_B           
;
PROBLEM: 
ADDSYM Detects Additional (Pseudo) Symm. Elem... a/2 Check 
RESPONSE: Crystal system initially incorrectly was defined as orthorhombic. 
Checking reflections showed that compound II crystallizes in 
the monoclinic crystal system monoclinic angle close to 90 degrees.
There is no problem. Additional checking in ADDSYM procedure in PLATON show that 
no obvious spacegroup (P 2/n) change.
;
